OL,3,ABack to school: How parents can save on
OL,4,Auniform costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBack to school can stir up many
OL,7,Femotions for parents, including anxiety
OL,8,Fabout the extra costs it brings.
OL,10,FAlmost half of parents said they're
OL,11,Fworried about the cost of school
OL,12,Funiforms, according to research by the
OL,13,Fcharity Save the Children and the Baby
OL,14,FBank Alliance network.
OL,16,FAnd a third of the 2,000 parents polled
OL,17,Fsaid they've sacrificed things for
OL,18,Fthemselves to meet back-to-school costs
OL,19,Flike uniforms, bags or books.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
